flowchart TD
    accTitle: Repair through evidence
    accDescr: Write a behavior claim, check the program, run its tests, read a failure, and repair the behavior or a mistaken expectation before running the complete suite again.
    A["WRITE<br/>One behavior claim"] --> B["CHECK<br/>Are the types compatible?"]
    B --> C["RUN<br/>Does the claim hold?"]
    C -->|inspect result| D["READ<br/>Expected value and actual value"]
    D --> E["REPAIR IF NEEDED<br/>Use the requirement"]
    E --> F["RERUN THE SUITE<br/>Keep the other promises"]
